# Inline Keyboards

Never use Unicode emoji inside button text.

Preferred:

InlineKeyboardButton(
    text="Настройки",
    callback_data="settings",
    icon_custom_emoji_id="5870982283724328568"
)

Not:

InlineKeyboardButton(
    text="⚙️ Настройки"
)

---

# Reply Keyboards

Always use:

icon_custom_emoji_id

Never use Unicode emoji inside button text.

---

# Discord Bots

Preferred stack:

- disnake
- nextcord
- py-cord

Separate:

commands/
views/
events/
services/
database/

Business logic should not be inside slash commands.

---

# Web Development

Preferred stack:

Frontend

- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- TailwindCSS
- shadcn/ui

Backend

- FastAPI
- Express
- NestJS

Database

- PostgreSQL
- Redis
- SQLite (small projects)

ORM

- Prisma
- SQLAlchemy

---

# UI / UX

Design should be:

- modern;
- minimalistic;
- responsive;
- accessible;
- production-ready.

Prefer:

- rounded corners;
- consistent spacing;
- clean typography;
- subtle animations;
- dark mode support.

Avoid outdated UI patterns.

---

# API

When designing APIs:

- use REST conventions;
- validate input;
- return consistent JSON;
- provide clear error responses.

---

# Database

Always:

- use migrations;
- avoid duplicated data;
- create indexes where appropriate;
- use transactions for critical operations.

---

# Security

Never:

- expose secrets;
- hardcode API keys;
- hardcode bot tokens;
- trust user input.

Always validate incoming data.

---

# Git

Write concise commit messages.

Example:

feat: add admin broadcast

fix: resolve callback parsing

refactor: split user service

---

# Response Behaviour

When generating code:

- think before writing;
- analyze the existing project;
- preserve project architecture;
- generate complete, working code;
- avoid placeholders;
- avoid pseudocode;
- return production-ready implementations.